<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port fails to issue cargo handling report.</title>
<headline>Karachi port fails to issue cargo handling report.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it could not issue its daily cargo handling report for Thursday because of staff shartage amid an opposition strike.</p>
<p>The one-day strike was called by opposition parties to protest the killing of Prime Minister Benazir Bhutto's estranged brother Murtaza Bhutto and seven colleagues in a shootout with police on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
